$('#p7-privacy').innerHTML=`<div class="p7-grid"><article class="p7-card"><small>PRIVACY VAULT</small><h3>Permission by design</h3><label class="p7-check"><input type="checkbox" id="p7AiContext"> Allow NEXUS records in AI context</label><label class="p7-check"><input type="checkbox" checked disabled> Local-first storage mode</label><p>Per-record visibility, AI-context permission, export/delete controls, retention suggestions and audit history are represented here. Existing AETHER privacy controls remain authoritative.</p><button class="secondary" id="p7Audit">View audit log</button><div id="p7AuditResult"></div></article><article class="p7-card"><small>EXPLAINABILITY</small><h3>AI/data boundary</h3><p>NEXUS uses the existing AETHER AI bridge only when you explicitly invoke an AI action. It does not silently upload the workspace.</p></article></div>`;
